# Pin LF line endings for this app's tree.
#
# The source-introspection tests under src/__tests__/*-static.test.ts read
# server.ts / config/index.ts / scripts/setup-api.sh and match multi-line
# section markers with `\n`. On a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true the
# working copy is CRLF, so those matches fail LOCALLY even though the code is
# correct — they pass on the Linux CI runner, which checks out LF. Forcing
# eol=lf makes every checkout match what the tests (and CI) expect.
#
# `text=auto` still auto-detects binaries (ARES.png, *.pdf, etc.) and leaves
# them untouched; only text files are normalized to LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
